# .clinerules — ICS Offshore & Energy ERP Project

## 1. Project Context

This is an internal ERP and inspection-management system for the Offshore & Energy Department of Iranian Classification Society (ICS).

The system manages workflows including:

* Third-Party Inspection (TPI)
* Marine Warranty Survey (MWS)
* Third-Party Engineering Review (TPER)
* Contracts
* Projects
* Inspections
* Inspectors
* Checklists
* Equipment records
* Certification
* Related operational and administrative workflows

This is an enterprise application. Architecture, domain integrity, maintainability, and backward compatibility are more important than quick shortcuts.

---

# 2. Technology Stack

* Frontend: React + TypeScript
* Architecture: Feature-Sliced Design (FSD)
* Local persistence: Dexie / IndexedDB
* Sync compatibility: in-memory cache where required
* Backend: FastAPI
* ORM: async SQLAlchemy
* Database migrations: Alembic
* Data source: Supabase for equipment taxonomy
* UI architecture: Design System + centralized Theme Engine

Inspection checklist system currently contains fixed inspection methods including:

* Pre-Inspection Meeting
* Document Review
* Visual Inspection
* Dimensional Inspection
* Marking / ID Verification
* Functional Verification
* Performance Verification
* Quantity
* Sampling
* NDT
* PMI
* Laboratory Test
* Hydrostatic Test

Do not modify the domain meaning of these workflows unless explicitly requested.

